+# [output] surface_stress_hours (0, the default, = off; patch 135): snapshots every so many hours of the friction
+# velocity u★ of the atmosphere–ocean and atmosphere–sea-ice fluxes (stress = ρₐ u★²), the wind (u, v of the
+# atmosphere regridded to the model grid) and the ice concentration, in arctic_surface_stress.jld2
+# (analysis/wind_stress_check.jl). Snapshots, not averages: the drag coefficient u★²/U² is not linear in the wind.
+stress_hours = get(output, "surface_stress_hours", 0)
+if stress_hours > 0
+    stress_interfaces = coupled_model.interfaces
+    atmosphere_state  = stress_interfaces.exchanger.atmosphere.state
+    stress_outputs = (; u★ᵃᵒ = stress_interfaces.atmosphere_ocean_interface.fluxes.friction_velocity,
+                        u★ᵃⁱ = stress_interfaces.atmosphere_sea_ice_interface.fluxes.friction_velocity,
+                        uᵃ = atmosphere_state.u, vᵃ = atmosphere_state.v,
+                        ℵ = sea_ice.model.ice_concentration)
+    simulation.output_writers[:surface_stress] = JLD2Writer(child, stress_outputs;
+                                                            filename = joinpath(output_dir, "arctic_surface_stress.jld2"),
+                                                            schedule = TimeInterval(stress_hours * Oceananigans.Units.hours),
+                                                            overwrite_files = !restart)
